//! Heeler desktop shell: Tauri commands bridging the UI to the Rust engine.
//! The UI sends its graph state; the command rebuilds a real heeler-graph
//! Graph through the Registry (same validation as everywhere else), executes
//! it on the CPU engine, and returns a JPEG data URL for the viewer.

